cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use NeuroKiln in research, please cite this software."
title: "NeuroKiln: reproducible, leakage-safe BCI algorithm evaluation and tuning"
abstract: >-
  NeuroKiln is an open-source platform for reproducible BCI algorithm evaluation.
  It combines dataset adapters, leakage-safe protocol splitting, a DAG pipeline
  engine, Grey Wolf hyperparameter optimization with Pareto auditing, statistical
  reporting and reproduction bundles.
type: software
authors:
  - name: "NeuroKiln Contributors"
version: 0.4.0
date-released: 2026-10-30
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - brain-computer interface
  - EEG
  - reproducibility
  - hyperparameter optimization
  - machine learning
  - neuroscience
